 "title": "Bartan dhone se $5 TRILLION tak! Jensen Huang ki kahani #shorts",
 "description": "Restaurant mein bartan dhone vaala ladka, jisne duniya ki pehli $5 trillion company khadi ki - Jensen Huang ki kahani\n- 1963: Taipei, Taiwan mein janm; 9 saal ki umar mein America\n- Galti se Kentucky ke ek reform school (Oneida Baptist Institute) mein daakhila\n- 15 saal ki umar se Denny's restaurant mein dishwasher, busboy, waiter\n- Oregon State se electrical engineering, Stanford se masters\n- 1993: ek Denny's mein Nvidia ka plan; $600 se shuruaat\n- Ek waqt sirf ~1 mahine ki salary ke paise bache; RIVA 128 ne bachaya\n- 12 Nov 2026: CEO pad se istifa\n\nSources:\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jensen_Huang\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nvidia\nhttps://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/12/why-did-nvidia-ceo-jensen-huang-resign-and-who-is-colette-kress\n\n#shorts #JensenHuang #Nvidia #SuccessStory #Motivation #StruggleStory #hindi #TechKahani",
